<title>UK: Philip Morris sets 300 mln mark seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Philip Morris sets 300 mln mark seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PHILIP MORRIS CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    11.MAR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.91    PAY DATE    11.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.75	REOFFER    99.51     SPREAD	+31 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
